  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0060_rival_01",
      "hash": "f88daec11e528db7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「等一下！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0060_rival_04",
      "hash": "f88da9c11e528538",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\n光只是捕捉寶可夢\\r\\n是不夠的！\\c\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]訓練家[VAR COLOR(0000)]之間還可以\\n用寶可夢來[VAR COLOR(0006)]對戰[VAR COLOR(0000)]喔！\\c\\n寶可夢對戰是什麼感覺？\\n我現在就來告訴[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0060_rival_05",
      "hash": "f88daac11e5286eb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "來對戰吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0060_8rom_01",
      "hash": "326ab01253605bf3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 3]"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0060_rival_02",
      "hash": "f88dafc11e528f6a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「唉……\\n我說得一副自己很厲害似的，\\r\\n真是太丟臉啦！\\c\\n早知道就先好好訓練一下，\\n再來跟[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳對戰了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0060_rival_06",
      "hash": "f88dabc11e52889e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「贏啦！\\c\\n……啊！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳也別太難過了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0060_rival_03",
      "hash": "f88db0c11e52911d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "以後我們三不五時\\n可以來比試一下喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0060_doctor_01",
      "hash": "82095c54a6abe594",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\n第一次對戰的感覺如何？\\c\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的搭檔[VAR POKNAME(0002)]\\n也非常努力喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0060_doctor_02",
      "hash": "82095f54a6abeaad",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳可以透過\\n和更多的訓練家對戰\\r\\n來培育[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的寶可夢！\\c\\n當然也不要忘了\\n多去捕捉新的寶可夢喔！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0060_max",
